{'global_id': 'medeasi_001024', 'source_text': 'Lung tumors are neoplastic tumors of the lung These include : Primary tumors of the lung/pulmonary system : Bronchial leiomyoma , a rare , benign tumor Lung cancer , the term commonly used to refer to carcinoma of the lung Pulmonary carcinoid tumor Pleuropulmonary blastoma Neuroendocrine tumors of the lung Lymphomas of the lung .', 'source_metrics': {'FRE': 4.82, 'ARI': 29.7, 'FKGL': 24.8, 'Dale-Chall': 12.83, 'char_count': 331, 'alphanum_count': 270, 'word_count': 55, 'sentence_count': 1}, 'metadata': {'dataset': 'medeasi', 'experiment_split': '', 'domain': 'medical', 'language': 'en', 'annotation': 'human', 'level': 'sentence'}, 'simplification_text': 'Some lung tumors are : Bronchial leiomyoma , a rare , benign tumor Lung cancer , the term commonly used to refer to carcinoma of the lung Pulmonary carcinoid tumor Pleuropulmonary blastoma Neuroendocrine tumors of the lung Lymphomas of the lung .', 'target_metrics': {'FRE': 17.0, 'ARI': 23.2, 'FKGL': 20.1, 'Dale-Chall': 12.73, 'char_count': 246, 'alphanum_count': 200, 'word_count': 42, 'sentence_count': 1, 'char_compression_rate': 0.74, 'word_compression_rate': 0.76, 'sentence_compression_rate': 1.0, 'BLEU': 64.69040813538675, 'BERTScore': 0.9663996696472168}, 'simplification_version': 1, 'grade_level': -1, 'simplification_dimensions': {'linguistic': {'lexical': False, 'syntactic': False}}}
