{'global_id': 'medeasi_001752', 'source_text': 'Beside the active vaccine itself, the following excipients are commonly present in vaccine preparations: Many vaccines need preservatives to prevent serious adverse effects such as Staphylococcus infection, which in one 1928 incident killed 12 of 21 children inoculated with a diphtheria vaccine that lacked a preservative.', 'source_metrics': {'FRE': -9.06, 'ARI': 30.0, 'FKGL': 26.0, 'Dale-Chall': 13.13, 'char_count': 323, 'alphanum_count': 266, 'word_count': 50, 'sentence_count': 1}, 'metadata': {'dataset': 'medeasi', 'experiment_split': '', 'domain': 'medical', 'language': 'en', 'annotation': 'human', 'level': 'sentence'}, 'simplification_text': 'Absence of any preservative in vaccine may result in adverse effects, such as Staphylococcus infection that, in one 1928 incident, killed 12 of 21 children inoculated with a diphtheria vaccine that lacked a preservative.', 'target_metrics': {'FRE': 11.59, 'ARI': 21.5, 'FKGL': 20.1, 'Dale-Chall': 12.29, 'char_count': 220, 'alphanum_count': 175, 'word_count': 38, 'sentence_count': 1, 'char_compression_rate': 0.68, 'word_compression_rate': 0.76, 'sentence_compression_rate': 1.0, 'BLEU': 39.45616005346947, 'BERTScore': 0.9379493594169617}, 'simplification_version': 1, 'grade_level': -1, 'simplification_dimensions': {'linguistic': {'lexical': False, 'syntactic': False}}}
